Download all the .py (python source files) contents within the zenex2.
After downloading or cloning the repository, open the project folder in VS Code, install the required dependencies using pip install -r requirements.txt
Then run python -m uvicorn main:app. Open http://127.0.0.1:8000 in a web browser to access the Orbital Edge Intelligence dashboard.

URL - https://zenex2.onrender.com/
(might not work due to server issues in render leading to poor deployment.

